EXCLUSIVE ARTIFACTS IN THIS REPOSITORY
--------------------------------------

  None. The umbrella repository itself does not publish an npm package, a
  marketplace extension, or a separately-licensed binary; it is the community
  monorepo. Exclusive artifacts (npm packages such as @elixpo/lixsketch and
  @elixpo/lixeditor, VS Code Marketplace extensions, hosted SaaS deployments,
  and reserved domains) belong to the individual products and are declared in
  those products' own notice boards.

